{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"retries\" expr=\"3\"/></datamodel>\n  <final id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <assign location=\"$retries\" expr=\"$retries-1\"/>\n    </onentry>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-hyphen-subtraction.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-hyphen-subtraction.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":10,"byteOffset":218,"endColumn":51,"endLine":5,"startColumn":41,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":"$retries - 1"}}]}],"description":{"text":"subtract with `$retries - 1`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-hyphen-subtraction.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":51,"endLine":5,"startColumn":41,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`$retries-1` is one undeclared variable named `retries-1`, not `$retries` minus `1`\n\n**Note:** an XPath variable exists only for a declared `<data id>` (and `<foreach item/index>` or `idlocation` names once they run) or a system variable; evaluating an undeclared one raises `error.execution`\n\n**Help:** `-` is part of an XPath name, so `$retries-1` is one variable; put spaces around `-` to subtract: `$retries - 1`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.10 System Variables\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.1 Data Model","text":"`$retries-1` is one undeclared variable named `retries-1`, not `$retries` minus `1`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":228,"start":218},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML056"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"in the XPath data model a variable exists only for a declared `<data id>` (and a `<foreach item/index>` or `idlocation` name once it runs) or a system variable (`_event`, `_sessionid`, `_name`, `_ioprocessors`); evaluating any other `$name` fails, and SCXML 1.0 defines that outcome (§5.9.3: \"If a value expression does not return a legal data value, the SCXML Processor MUST place the error 'error.execution' in the internal event queue\"; a condition is then false, §5.9.1), so the document compiles. `.` is part of an XPath name, so `$user.name` is one undeclared variable, not a member access"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use a declared variable (the finding suggests the nearest one), select a child with a path such as `$user/name`, or declare the variable with `<data id=\"name\"/>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.1 Data Model\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML056` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/2014/CR-scxml-20140313/#xpath-datamodel","id":"SCXML056","name":"SCXML056","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an XPath expression references a variable the machine never declares"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}